{"id":"vod_zy360_74504","vodId":"74504","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"光逝去的夏天","name_cn":"光逝去的夏天","date":"2025-01-01","year":"2025","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20250706-1/e013ce73802ec82d322a5fc7c3e8a1c9.jpg"},"summary":"佳纪和光住在乡下小村庄，两人一起长大，从小形影不离。燠热难当的艳阳。此起彼落的蝉鸣。回家路上的冰淇淋。那天，一个再完美不过的平凡夏日，他们随口闲聊，哈哈大笑。佳纪忽然转头问光：“其实你不是光吧？”六个月前，光在山里走失，一星期后离奇归来。这个光的容貌和言语都与原本的光别无二致，但他体内有某种不太对劲的东西在骚动。“光已经不在了，那样的话，你……”佳纪继续与那个模仿光的“东西”相处，假装一切都没有改变。然而，村庄里却开始怪事频传。渐渐坠入某个未知的“东西”……以成长为主题的恐怖故事拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,悬疑,惊悚,奇幻"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-09-28 11:27:13","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250706/qrHpwlRV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250713/wrVoLA51/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250720/XTO5uwlz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250727/u181FxVJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250803/UcwzYv3Y/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250810/oZzJXny9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250817/Doo2ctBR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250824/68rCm5l7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250907/J0KGmhSW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250914/IMYXjDXA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250921/wUo0rUyu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250928/9R8YJUma/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:16.986Z"}